    "summary": "Your Shooting Phase or either Fight Phase. Choose a CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER unit of yours that has yet to be picked to shoot or fight in that phase. Also designate a single enemy unit with the MONSTER or VEHICLE keyword. Through this phase, your unit can reroll Hit and Wound rolls of 1 against the designated enemy. If that enemy is TITANIC, it can reroll any Hit or Wound roll against it instead.",
